From 7fbcc08a19d70afee3d96a0b4cc249bd13492a46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jarren Rocks <8302364+jarrenrocks@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 23:01:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 12/54] Aerie gets its underside: rock, roots, vines and a
 cloud sea

Past the rim the terrain is out of sight, and what hangs there instead is a mass of rock
and soil tapering to a point, vines swaying off the edge, a sea of soft cloud far below,
and puffs drifting round the island. Grass stops at the rim. The sky shape's drop is now
computed after the height it drops.

