Subject: [PATCH 17/54] Aerie: plugs face outward and wear a soil cap

The ring triangles were wound clockwise, so the outer faces were culled and
you saw the far inside wall through the missing front. Flipped. And the top
ring was open, so the frayed grass edge looked down into the hollow; a soil
cap fan closes it.

