Subject: [PATCH 18/54] Keep the thread card when the UI is hidden

Hiding the UI faded the whole HUD layer, card included, so clicking an
astronaut in the clean view showed nothing. The fade now applies to every
panel but the card, which stays beside its astronaut with its buttons live.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
