Subject: [PATCH 21/54] Hidden HUD panels go invisible, not just transparent

At opacity 0 a blurred panel is still a composited layer over the live
canvas, and Chromium flickers black rectangles where the sidebar and
settings sit whenever the camera moves. visibility: hidden after the fade
takes them out of compositing; it flips back immediately on show.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
