Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 08:45:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 44/54] Address review round 2: cut-first slot math, one
 projectKey, named chips

A leaver that is in the scan but capped out of the cut slipped both the
slot count and the revival, so the crew could overshoot the cap and
un-draw the newest spawns; the cut now runs first and only leavers it
did not re-adopt reserve a slot. The 'unknown' grouping rule now has one
definition (projectKey in roster.js) used by the colony, the card, the
legend, selection and hiding alike. The chip statuses are named outright
instead of sliced off STATUS_ORDER, pinned by a test, so reordering the
spawn priority cannot silently change what the guarantee covers.

